{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-algorithms","title":"经典限流算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations/classic-algorithms","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"经典限流算法\">经典限流算法</h1><p>四种经典限流算法——固定窗口、滑动窗口、令牌桶、漏桶——构成了所有现代限流系统的算法基础。它们的差异不在于&quot;哪个更好&quot;，而在于各自针对不同的失败模式做了不同的取舍。理解每种算法的内部数据结构和边界行为，是做出正确选型的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有限流算法的本质都是在&quot;精度&quot;、&quot;内存&quot;、&quot;突发容忍&quot;三个维度上做不同的取舍。精度越高（如滑动窗口日志的逐请求记录），内存消耗越大；允许突发（如令牌桶的桶容量机制），就意味着瞬时吞吐量可能超过平均速率。没有完美的算法——只有匹配具体约束的最佳选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"固定窗口计数器\">固定窗口计数器</h2><p>固定窗口（Fixed Window Counter）将时间轴切分为等长的不重叠窗口，每个窗口内维护一个计数器。请求到来时计数器加一，超过阈值则拒绝，窗口结束时计数器归零。</p>\n<p><strong>数据结构</strong>：一个计数器 + 一个窗口开始时间戳。Redis 实现中只需一个 STRING 键配合 <code>EXPIRE</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>核心逻辑</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"窗口 = floor(当前时间 / 窗口大小)&#10;键 = &quot;rl:{用户}:{窗口}&quot;&#10;计数 = INCR(键)&#10;如果 计数 == 1:&#10;    EXPIRE(键, 窗口大小)&#10;如果 计数 &gt; 限额:&#10;    拒绝请求\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>窗口 = floor(当前时间 / 窗口大小)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>键 = \"rl:{用户}:{窗口}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>计数 = INCR(键)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>如果 计数 == 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    EXPIRE(键, 窗口大小)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>如果 计数 > 限额:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    拒绝请求</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>致命缺陷——边界突刺</strong>：假设限额为 100 req/min，用户在第一个窗口的最后 1 秒发送 100 个请求，又在下一个窗口的第一个 1 秒发送 100 个请求。虽然每个窗口都没有超限，但在 2 秒的实际时间段内系统承受了 200 个请求——是限额的 2 倍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间段</th>\n<th>窗口 1 计数</th>\n<th>窗口 2 计数</th>\n<th>实际 2 秒内请求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常分布</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>~50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界攻击</td>\n<td>100（末尾集中）</td>\n<td>100（开头集中）</td>\n<td>200</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口日志\">滑动窗口日志</h2><p>滑动窗口日志（Sliding Window Log）记录每个请求的精确时间戳，判断时统计当前时间向前回溯一个窗口长度内的请求数。</p>\n<p><strong>数据结构</strong>：Redis Sorted Set，score 为时间戳，member 为请求唯一标识。</p>\n<p><strong>操作流程</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. ZREMRANGEBYSCORE(键, 0, 当前时间 - 窗口大小)  // 清理过期条目&#10;2. 计数 = ZCARD(键)                               // 统计窗口内请求数&#10;3. 如果 计数 &lt; 限额:&#10;     ZADD(键, 当前时间, 请求ID)                   // 记录本次请求&#10;     放行&#10;4. 否则:&#10;     拒绝\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. ZREMRANGEBYSCORE(键, 0, 当前时间 - 窗口大小)  // 清理过期条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 计数 = ZCARD(键)                               // 统计窗口内请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 如果 计数 &#x3C; 限额:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     ZADD(键, 当前时间, 请求ID)                   // 记录本次请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     放行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 否则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     拒绝</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：精确——没有边界突刺问题，每个时间点回溯一个完整窗口。</p>\n<p><strong>代价</strong>：内存消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是窗口内允许的最大请求数。对于 10000 req/min 的限额，每个用户需要存储 10000 个时间戳条目。在高配额场景下内存开销巨大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口计数器\">滑动窗口计数器</h2><p>滑动窗口计数器（Sliding Window Counter）是固定窗口与滑动日志的折中方案——用两个相邻窗口的加权计数来近似滑动窗口的效果，既解决了边界突刺，又保持了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的内存开销。</p>\n<p><strong>核心公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效计数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>当前窗口计数</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>前一窗口计数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mtext>窗口剩余时间</mtext><mtext>窗口大小</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效计数} = \\text{当前窗口计数} + \\text{前一窗口计数} \\times \\frac{\\text{窗口剩余时间}}{\\text{窗口大小}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效计数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前窗口计数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">前一窗口计数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口大小</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口剩余时间</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如窗口大小 60 秒，当前位于窗口的第 15 秒处：前一窗口计数 42，当前窗口计数 18。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效计数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>49.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效计数} = 18 + 42 \\times \\frac{60 - 15}{60} = 18 + 42 \\times 0.75 = 49.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效计数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">49.5</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;前一窗口&lt;br/&gt;计数: 42&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;当前窗口&lt;br/&gt;计数: 18&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;加权结果&lt;br/&gt;49.5&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D[&quot;权重: 75%&lt;br/&gt;(剩余占比)&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    E[&quot;权重: 100%&quot;] --&gt; B\">graph LR\n    A[\"前一窗口&lt;br/&gt;计数: 42\"] --&gt; B[\"当前窗口&lt;br/&gt;计数: 18\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"加权结果&lt;br/&gt;49.5\"]\n\n    D[\"权重: 75%&lt;br/&gt;(剩余占比)\"] --&gt; A\n    E[\"权重: 100%\"] --&gt; B</pre><p><strong>精度评估</strong>：Cloudflare 在 4 亿请求的生产流量中实测误差率仅为 0.003%。对于绝大多数 API 限流场景，这个精度已经足够。</p>\n<p><strong>Redis 实现</strong>：只需两个 STRING 键（当前窗口计数 + 前一窗口计数），通过 Lua 脚本在一次原子操作中完成加权计算与判决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"令牌桶算法\">令牌桶算法</h2><p>令牌桶（Token Bucket）以固定速率向桶中添加令牌，每个请求消耗一个（或多个）令牌。桶满时多余的令牌被丢弃，桶空时请求被拒绝。</p>\n<p><strong>两个关键参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（refill rate）：令牌填充速率，如 10 tokens/sec</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（bucket capacity）：桶的最大容量，即允许的最大突发量</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>懒惰填充技巧</strong>：实际实现中不需要后台定时器持续填充。每次请求到来时，根据距上次操作的时间差计算应补充的令牌数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>新增令牌</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>当前时间</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>上次填充时间</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{新增令牌} = (\\text{当前时间} - \\text{上次填充时间}) \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新增令牌</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上次填充时间</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>当前令牌</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>剩余令牌</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>新增令牌</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{当前令牌} = \\min(b, \\text{剩余令牌} + \\text{新增令牌})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前令牌</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">剩余令牌</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新增令牌</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>行为特征</strong>：令牌桶允许受控的突发——当桶是满的时候，客户端可以一次性发送 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求。之后必须以平均速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 持续消费。这个特性与真实客户端行为（移动端批量同步、定时任务集中执行）天然匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>Redis 实现</strong>：一个 HASH 键包含两个字段（<code>tokens</code> 和 <code>last_refill</code>），通过 Lua 脚本实现原子化的&quot;计算补充→扣减→返回&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漏桶算法\">漏桶算法</h2><p>漏桶（Leaky Bucket）的形象比喻是一个底部有小孔的水桶：请求像水一样倒入桶中，桶以恒定速率&quot;漏出&quot;（处理）。桶满时新请求被丢弃（policing 模式）或排队等待（shaping 模式）。</p>\n<p><strong>两种运行模式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>超限行为</th>\n<th>客户端体验</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Policing（执法）</td>\n<td>直接丢弃</td>\n<td>立即收到 429</td>\n<td>API 限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shaping（整形）</td>\n<td>排队延迟</td>\n<td>请求被延迟处理</td>\n<td>消息队列消费、流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>与令牌桶的本质差异</strong>：令牌桶控制的是&quot;平均速率+允许突发&quot;，漏桶控制的是&quot;严格恒定的输出速率&quot;。如果你的后端系统对突发流量敏感（如需要匀速写入时序数据库），漏桶是更好的选择。</p>\n<p><strong>GCRA（Generic Cell Rate Algorithm）</strong>：漏桶的一种优雅实现变体，被 Redis Cell 模块采用。它不维护队列，只记录一个&quot;理论到达时间&quot;（TAT），通过比较当前时间与 TAT 来决定放行或拒绝：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TAT</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>TAT</mtext><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>当前时间</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>发射间隔</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TAT}_{new} = \\max(\\text{TAT}_{old}, \\text{当前时间}) + \\text{发射间隔}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TAT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TAT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前时间</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发射间隔</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TAT</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>当前时间</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>容忍延迟</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TAT}_{new} - \\text{当前时间} &gt; \\text{容忍延迟}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TAT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">容忍延迟</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则拒绝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种算法对比总表\">四种算法对比总表</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>固定窗口</th>\n<th>滑动窗口计数器</th>\n<th>令牌桶</th>\n<th>漏桶</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存/键</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 1 KEY</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 2 KEYs</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 1 HASH</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 1 HASH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度</td>\n<td>近似（有边界突刺）</td>\n<td>近似（误差 &lt;0.01%）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突发容忍</td>\n<td>允许 2x 边界突发</td>\n<td>平滑</td>\n<td>允许受控突发</td>\n<td>无突发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最佳场景</td>\n<td>低频接口、登录限制</td>\n<td>通用 API 限流</td>\n<td>突发性流量</td>\n<td>匀速消费场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>固定窗口实现最简单但有 2x 边界突刺风险，适合对精度要求不高的辅助接口</li>\n<li>滑动窗口计数器以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内存代价实现近乎精确的限流，是通用 API 的首选</li>\n<li>令牌桶通过桶容量参数允许受控突发，与真实客户端行为模式最匹配</li>\n<li>漏桶保证恒定输出速率，适合对后端写入速率敏感的场景</li>\n<li>实际生产中常混合使用：网关层用滑动窗口做全局保护，服务层用令牌桶做细粒度控制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"algorithm-selection\">算法选型与权衡</a> 提供面向具体业务场景的决策框架</li>\n<li>服务网格中的弹性模式（熔断、重试、超时）如何与限流协同：<a href=\"../../service-mesh/traffic-management/resilience-patterns\">弹性模式</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经典限流算法","id":"经典限流算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"固定窗口计数器","id":"固定窗口计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口日志","id":"滑动窗口日志"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口计数器","id":"滑动窗口计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌桶算法","id":"令牌桶算法"},{"level":2,"text":"漏桶算法","id":"漏桶算法"},{"level":2,"text":"四种算法对比总表","id":"四种算法对比总表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"限流基本概念与动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations/rate-limiting-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"算法选型与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations/algorithm-selection"}}